      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Supplying both silently ignored --to and broadcast to everyone, a surprising and privacy-relevant footgun.",
      "statement": "The send command shall treat --to and --broadcast as mutually exclusive and reject an invocation that supplies both.",
